# 🌍 StudyBuddy Global

StudyBuddy Global is an AI-powered peer-to-peer learning platform that connects students from around the world to learn together, ask questions, share knowledge, and grow through collaboration.

## 🚀 Vision

Education should have no borders.

StudyBuddy Global aims to create a global community where students can:
- 📚 Learn together
- 🤖 Use AI for studying
- 🌎 Connect with students worldwide
- 💬 Chat and collaborate
- 🏆 Earn XP and achievements

## ✨ Current Features

- User Authentication
- Student Profiles
- AI Study Assistant
- Real-time Chat
- Subject-based Learning
- XP & Badges
- Global Community

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

### Backend
- Python
- Flask

### Database
- PostgreSQL

